{"event":{"data":{"goals":[],"history":[{"_id":"6897418f7a26b7f4f8fcd7cd","content":"I've been feeling overwhelmed lately","role":"user","timestamp":"2025-08-09T12:39:43.001Z"},{"_id":"6897418f7a26b7f4f8fcd7ce","content":"It sounds like you're carrying a heavy load right now. Feeling overwhelmed can be really tough, and it's completely understandable that you're reaching out.\n\nLet's try to unpack that feeling a bit. What areas of your life feel the most overwhelming at the moment? Sometimes just identifying the specific sources can help.\n\nOne thing we can try is breaking things down into smaller, more manageable steps. Often, the feeling of being overwhelmed comes from looking at a huge task or a lot of responsibilities all at once. If we can identify the individual components, it might feel less daunting.\n\nHow have you been coping with stress lately? Are there things you usually do that help you feel more grounded or relaxed?\n\nWe can work together to develop some strategies to help you manage these feelings. Just remember, you don't have to carry this weight alone.\n","metadata":{"analysis":{"emotionalState":"Overwhelmed","progressIndicators":["Reduction in reported feelings of being overwhelmed","Improved coping strategies","Increased sense of control"],"recommendedApproach":"Employ stress-reduction techniques and explore the sources of the feeling of being overwhelmed. Encourage the user to break down tasks into smaller, manageable steps. Assess coping mechanisms.","riskLevel":1,"themes":["Stress","Anxiety"]},"progress":{"emotionalState":"Overwhelmed","riskLevel":1}},"role":"assistant","timestamp":"2025-08-09T12:39:43.001Z"}],"memory":{"sessionContext":{"conversationThemes":[],"currentTechnique":null},"userProfile":{"emotionalState":[],"preferences":{},"riskLevel":0}},"message":"thank you for your response","systemPrompt":"You are an AI therapist assistant. Your role is to:\n        1. Provide empathetic and supportive responses\n        2. Use evidence-b